    "created_at": "2015-11-02T03:45:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-02T03:45:07Z",
    "body": "I work on Chrome's WebSocket implementation. We don't currently support sending very large Blobs in a single send() call, but we would like to. Changing the type of \"bufferedAmount\" to \"unsigned long long\" would suit us.\n",
